{
 "segments": [
  {
   "id": "c02-title-01",
   "scene": "c02-title",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Part two. Question ḥarfs.",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": [
    "title"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c02-title-02",
   "scene": "c02-title",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "هَلْ",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c02-title-03",
   "scene": "c02-title",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "أَ",
   "pause": 0.4,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c02-title-04",
   "scene": "c02-title",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "These two turn a normal sentence into a yes or no question.",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": [
    "sub"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c02-title-05",
   "scene": "c02-title",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "The answer starts with yes or no.",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c02-title-06",
   "scene": "c02-title",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "نَعَمْ",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c02-title-07",
   "scene": "c02-title",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "لَا",
   "pause": 0.5,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c02-examples-01",
   "scene": "c02-examples",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Is this a house? Yes, this is a house.",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": [
    "ex:1"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c02-examples-02",
   "scene": "c02-examples",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "هَلْ هَذَا بَيْتٌ؟",
   "pause": 0.4,
   "cues": [
    "say:1"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c02-examples-03",
   "scene": "c02-examples",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "نَعَمْ، هَذَا بَيْتٌ",
   "pause": 0.5,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c02-examples-04",
   "scene": "c02-examples",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Without the question ḥarf, this is a normal sentence. With it, it is a question.",
   "pause": 0.5,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c02-examples-05",
   "scene": "c02-examples",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Is this a pen? No, this is a key.",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": [
    "ex:2"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c02-examples-06",
   "scene": "c02-examples",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "أَهَذَا قَلَمٌ؟",
   "pause": 0.4,
   "cues": [
    "say:2"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c02-examples-07",
   "scene": "c02-examples",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "لَا، هَذَا مِفْتَاحٌ",
   "pause": 0.5,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c02-examples-08",
   "scene": "c02-examples",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Here the question ḥarf is the short one at the very start. It is written joined to the next word.",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c02-examples-09",
   "scene": "c02-examples",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "This one is from the Madinah book.",
   "pause": 0.5,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c02-examples-10",
   "scene": "c02-examples",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Did Ali go to the principal? Yes.",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": [
    "ex:3"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c02-examples-11",
   "scene": "c02-examples",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "أَذَهَبَ عَلِيٌّ إِلَى الْمُدِيرِ؟",
   "pause": 0.4,
   "cues": [
    "say:3"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c02-examples-12",
   "scene": "c02-examples",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "نَعَمْ",
   "pause": 0.5,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c02-examples-13",
   "scene": "c02-examples",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "It is the same small ḥarf. This time it is joined to a verb.",
   "pause": 0.6,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c02-cols-01",
   "scene": "c02-cols",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "So there are two kinds of question word.",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c02-cols-02",
   "scene": "c02-cols",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "A question ism has a job in the sentence.",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": [
    "col:1",
    "hl:Has a job in the sentence"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c02-cols-03",
   "scene": "c02-cols",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "It asks for a person, a thing, a place or a time.",
   "pause": 0.5,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c02-cols-04",
   "scene": "c02-cols",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "A question ḥarf has no job.",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": [
    "col:2",
    "hl:Has no job."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c02-cols-05",
   "scene": "c02-cols",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "It only makes a yes or no question.",
   "pause": 0.6,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c02-tip-01",
   "scene": "c02-tip",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Never answer a where, who or when question with yes or no.",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": [
    "show",
    "hl:Never answer"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c02-tip-02",
   "scene": "c02-tip",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Only the two question ḥarfs take a yes or no answer.",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c02-tip-03",
   "scene": "c02-tip",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "هَلْ",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": [
    "hl:هَلْ"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c02-tip-04",
   "scene": "c02-tip",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "أَ",
   "pause": 0.7,
   "cues": [
    "hl:أَ"
   ]
  }
 ]
}